32
00:02:05,603 --> 00:02:05,924
打ちのめされた嘆きの糧で
あらがい続けた感情

33
00:02:05,964 --> 00:02:06,525
闇より響く、
遥かな期待を信じてる者たち

34
00:02:24,749 --> 00:02:25,629
Hey

35
00:02:25,790 --> 00:02:26,990
yellow

36
00:02:27,031 --> 00:02:29,392
Hey，yellow

37
00:02:29,512 --> 00:02:33,674
高到無可低於貌

38
00:02:34,315 --> 00:02:35,235
Hey

39
00:02:35,355 --> 00:02:38,917
you were
gonna be somebody

40
00:02:39,078 --> 00:02:40,919
So you know

41
00:02:40,959 --> 00:02:42,640
and see that

42
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,041
While you're
getting all those stars made higher

43
00:02:45,081 --> 00:02:46,962
So you might have
knocked yourself on the eye

44
00:02:47,002 --> 00:02:50,004
You may be just
walking on the wire

45
